# Keeps the build context small and makes sure no local build output, secret or IDE state ends up in an image.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store
**/*.user
.git/
.github/
.env
.env.*
docs/
*.md
*.http
# Tests are not part of the image (the Dockerfile only copies the four production projects anyway).
HannasHabits.*.Tests/
